 — 1Ki 4:15.","refs":["1Ki 4:15"]},{"index":22,"text":"Land of, ravaged by Benhadad — 1Ki 15:20.","refs":["1Ki 15:20"]},{"index":23,"text":"Land of, purged of idols by Josiah — 2Ch 34:6.","refs":["2Ch 34:6"]},{"index":24,"text":"Taken captive by Tiglathpileser — 2Ki 15:29.","refs":["2Ki 15:29"]},{"index":25,"text":"Specially favoured by our Lord’s ministry — Isa 9:1,2; Mt 4:13-15.","refs":["Isa 9:1,2","Mt 4:13-15"]},{"index":26,"text":"Remarkable persons of","refs":[]},{"index":27,"text":"Barak. — Jdj 4:6.","refs":["Jdj 4:6"]},{"index":28,"text":"Hiram. — 1Ki 7:14.","refs":["1Ki 7:14"]}]},{"slug":"nazarites","name":"Nazarites","source":"torrey","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"index":1,"text":"Persons separated to the service of God — Nu 6:2.","refs":["Nu 6:2"]},{"index":2,"text":"Different kinds of","refs":[]},{"index":3,"text":"From the womb. — Jdj 13:5; Lu 1:15.","refs":["Jdj 13:5","Lu 1:15"]},{"index":4,"text":"By a particular vow. — Nu 6:2.","refs":["Nu 6:2"]},{"index":5,"text":"Required to be holy — Nu 6:8.","refs":["Nu 6:8"]},{"index":6,"text":"Esteemed pure — La 4:7.","refs":["La 4:7"]},{"index":7,"text":"Prohibited from","refs":[]},{"index":8,"text":"Wine or strong drink. — Nu 6:3; Lu 1:15.","refs":["Nu 6:3","Lu 1:15"]},{"index":9,"text":"Grapes or anything made from the vine. — Nu 6:3,4; Jdj 13:14.","refs":["Nu 6:3,4","Jdj 13:14"]},{"index":10,"text":"Cutting or shaving the head. — Nu 6:5; Jdj 13:5; 16:17.","refs":["Nu 6:5","Jdj 13:5; 16:17"]},{"index":11,"text":"Defiling themselves by the dead. — Nu 6:6,7.","refs":["Nu 6:6,7"]},{"index":12,"text":"Raised up for good of the nation — Am 2:11.","refs":["Am 2:11"]},{"index":13,"text":"Ungodly Jews tried to corrupt — Am 2:12.","refs":["Am 2:12"]},{"index":14,"text":"Defiled during vow","refs":[]},{"index":15,"text":"To shave the head the seventh day. — Nu 6:9.","refs":["Nu 6:9"]},{"index":16,"text":"To bring two turtle doves for a burnt offering. — Nu 6:10,11.","refs":["Nu 6:10,11"]},{"index":17,"text":"To recompense