3"]},{"index":3,"text":"Effected by","refs":[]},{"index":4,"text":"God. — Joh 1:13; 1Pe 1:3.","refs":["Joh 1:13","1Pe 1:3"]},{"index":5,"text":"Christ. — 1Jo 2:29.","refs":["1Jo 2:29"]},{"index":6,"text":"The Holy Spirit. — Joh 3:6; Tit 3:5.","refs":["Joh 3:6","Tit 3:5"]},{"index":7,"text":"Through the instrumentality of","refs":[]},{"index":8,"text":"The word of God. — Jas 1:18; 1Pe 1:23.","refs":["Jas 1:18","1Pe 1:23"]},{"index":9,"text":"The resurrection of Christ. — 1Pe 1:3.","refs":["1Pe 1:3"]},{"index":10,"text":"The ministry of the gospel. — 1Co 4:15.","refs":["1Co 4:15"]},{"index":11,"text":"Is of the will of God — Jas 1:18.","refs":["Jas 1:18"]},{"index":12,"text":"Is of the mercy of God — Tit 3:5.","refs":["Tit 3:5"]},{"index":13,"text":"Is for the glory of God — Isa 43:7.","refs":["Isa 43:7"]},{"index":14,"text":"Described as","refs":[]},{"index":15,"text":"A new creation. — 2Co 5:17; Ga 6:15; Eph 2:10.","refs":["2Co 5:17","Ga 6:15","Eph 2:10"]},{"index":16,"text":"Newness of life. — Ro 6:4.","refs":["Ro 6:4"]},{"index":17,"text":"A spiritual resurrection. — Ro 6:4-6; Eph 2:1,5; Col 2:12; 3:1.","refs":["Ro 6:4-6","Eph 2:1,5","Col 2:12; 3:1"]},{"index":18,"text":"A new heart. — Eze 36:26.","refs":["Eze 36:26"]},{"index":19,"text":"A new spirit. — Eze 11:19; Ro 7:6.","refs":["Eze 11:19","Ro 7:6"]},{"index":20,"text":"Putting on the new man. — Eph 4:24.","refs":["Eph 4:24"]},{"index":21,"text":"The inward man. — Ro 7:22; 2Co 4:16.","refs":["Ro 7:22","2Co 4:16"]},{"index":22,"text":"Circumcision of the heart. — De 30:6; Ro 2:29; Col 2:11.","refs":["De 30:6","Ro 2:29","Col 2:11"]},{"index":23,"text":"Partaking of the divine nature. — 2Pe 1:4.","refs":["2Pe 1:4"]},{"index":24,"text":"The washing of regeneration. — Tit 3:5.","refs":["Tit 3:5"]},{"index":25,"text":"All saints partake of — Ro 8:16,17; 1Pe 2:2; 1Jo 5:1.","refs":["Ro 8:16,17","1Pe 2:2","1Jo 5:1"]},{"index":26,"text":"Produces","refs":[]},{"index":27,"text":"Likeness to God. — Eph 4:24; Col 3:10.","r